00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:26.000
Iranian officials have framed such actions as responses to prior U.S. and allied pressure in the region.

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:31.600
Chinese state media have noted the nationality of the firm without assigning blame.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:38.540
The shared facts are the location, the reported casualties, and the attribution to an Iranian strike.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:46.180
Interpretations differ on whether the target was chosen for its Chinese connection or its location near strategic sites.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:51.880
Kuwait has maintained diplomatic channels with multiple parties while investigating the event.

00:03:51.880 --> 00:04:00.340
What happens next? Kuwait and Chinese officials are expected to issue further statements on the investigation and any diplomatic steps.

