00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:55.340
Past plenums have varied in their public emphasis on discipline versus policy direction.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:05:02.640
What happens next? Further details on the agenda are expected in the coming weeks from official party channels.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:12.760
Meanwhile, protests over jobs continue in India. Protests have continued in India over limited job opportunities for recent university graduates.

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:20.980
Reports link the demonstrations to a mismatch between the number of degree holders and available positions matching their qualifications.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:27.080
Demonstrations have taken place in several cities and involve students and recent graduates.

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:38.920
The scale of the protests reflects the size of the annual graduating cohort. Government statements emphasize ongoing efforts to expand vocational training and private sector hiring.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:49.540
Student groups and labor organizations argue that exam-based selection systems and slow public sector recruitment have left many qualified candidates without work.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:56.400
The underlying data show rising numbers of graduates alongside persistent vacancies in certain sectors.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:04.380
